Package: hostsync
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, rsync, openssh-client
Recommends: sshpass, dnsutils
Description: rsync wrapper for syncing files across many hosts
 hostsync pushes files or directories to one or many hosts over rsync and
 ssh, with host lists, subnet and domain discovery, and exclusions.
